00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.060
It's great.

245
00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:19.680
Just all office facts.

246
00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:20.220
It's great.

247
00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:21.940
And I found this charming.

