00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:40.300
of Skating with Celebrities.

253
00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:41.380
Oh.

254
00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:46.900
So in the United States, we aired on NBC, and Skating with Celebrities aired on Fox.

255
00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:52.340
But in Canada, they both aired on the same network, this global television network.

256
00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:58.000
And the finale of Skating with Celebrities was at the same time as this episode, so they

