1557
01:02:32.330 --> 01:02:34.870
So I've also stayed there, and I concur.

1558
01:02:35.170 --> 01:02:36.130
It's a great hotel.

1559
01:02:36.310 --> 01:02:36.850
Great hotel.

1560
01:02:37.010 --> 01:02:37.590
Super charming.

1561
01:02:37.730 --> 01:02:38.410
Super charming.

1562
01:02:38.410 --> 01:02:41.810
So now Dwight and Michael are sort of having this great moment at the bar.

1563
01:02:41.990 --> 01:02:44.870
They're laughing, and it's all wrapping up.

1564
01:02:44.970 --> 01:02:49.250
But guess who's the last person to touch the thermostat back in the office?

1565
01:02:50.150 --> 01:02:50.830
Who?

1566
